 "transcript": [
  "[action] Wang Lung works the soil with his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is so and I am ashamed, for they are so proud and so mean and they care so little for their father and their land. And it is so that I have not told them and I have not made them understand and now I see that my father will not die and I must be ashamed and have shame in my heart and I must make them understand and I must take them to me and I must make them see and I must make them see.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung listens to his son's words.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What now, my son?\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung continues working the soil",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and say on.\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what now, my son?\"",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"If you will, I will tell him.\"",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"I was thinking of selling our fields and I would like to see the money before I do it, for the money is better than the land.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"If that is so, then I will ask for it and I will take it and I will not give it to my brothers and I will take it and I will not give it to my brothers and I will not give it to my brothers and I will not give it to my brothers.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son takes his father's money.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sleeps restlessly.",
  "[action] Wang Lung observes his son's behavior.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son returns from the market.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and the money is mine, is it not?\"",
  "[silence] (to Wang Lung) the second son says nothing.",
